 zig/src/families/qwen3_5/cuda_layers.zig    |  4 ---
 zig/src/families/qwen3_5/cuda_loop_plan.zig | 15 +++++++++---
 zig/src/families/qwen3_5/cuda_mhc.zig       | 27 +++++++++++----------
 4 files changed, 31 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

